{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d69074723dd1e33f","type":"text","text":"#### Port Scanning","x":-440,"y":-80,"width":171,"height":60},
		{"id":"63abf4d2a006fa9f","type":"text","text":"Stealth Scan (Half open scan)","x":-78,"y":23,"width":267,"height":60},
		{"id":"b8e33e4b98d6f909","type":"text","text":"Tcp connect / Full open scan","x":-80,"y":-160,"width":269,"height":60},
		{"id":"8ec8620e82c4f454","type":"text","text":"TCP connect scan `establishes a full connection ` and close the connection by send an `RST` packet. It is fully `3 way handshake`. ","x":280,"y":-160,"width":520,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d8f498d9791a48c","type":"text","text":"Attacker use stealth scanning technique to `bypass firewall rules` as well as `logging machanism` and hide themselves under the appearance regular network traffic   ","x":280,"y":5,"width":520,"height":97},
		{"id":"e9ddeb97e845d1f6","type":"text","text":"Open TCP Scanning Methods","x":-118,"y":464,"width":267,"height":60},
		{"id":"b3a88141f539f259","type":"text","text":"# TCP SCANNING","x":-920,"y":778,"width":220,"height":60},
		{"id":"1629d673a3d4f934","type":"text","text":"TCP connect / Full open scan","x":264,"y":464,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"da142ed70a99a912","type":"text","text":"Ye scan operating system ke normal `connect()` system call ka use karta hai. or target machine ke har port ko check karata h","x":661,"y":444,"width":499,"height":101},
		{"id":"86151a7751ee10ae","type":"text","text":"Jab scanner ke paas **raw packet bhejne ki permission nahi hoti** (jaise root/admin privileges nahi hote), tab Nmap **TCP Connect Scan (`-sT`)** use karta hai.","x":661,"y":300,"width":499,"height":120},
		{"id":"e5dcbb87d0f64fe7","type":"text","text":"| TCP Connect Scan (`-sT`)                | TCP SYN Scan (`-sS`)           |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Full 3-way handshake complete karta hai | Sirf handshake start karta hai |\n| Connection establish hota hai           | Connection complete nahi hota  |\n| Easily logged by server                 | Kam noticeable hota hai        |\n| Root privilege ki zarurat nahi          | Root privilege chahiye         |\n| Thoda slower                            | Faster                         |\n","x":1320,"y":344,"width":612,"height":200},
		{"id":"3141b551dbfce8cb","type":"text","text":"Open ports","x":2180,"y":340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0611dff2995dfd93","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN+PORT ------>S\nA <--- SYN+ACK       ------ S\nA ------- ACK ---------->S\nA ------- RST ---------->S","x":2580,"y":311,"width":260,"height":119},
		{"id":"75490f59332d0caf","type":"text","text":"Close ports","x":2180,"y":514,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b67bdb3fd1967962","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN+PORT ------>S\n \nA <------- RST ---------- S","x":2580,"y":500,"width":260,"height":89},
		{"id":"035a3d40989248d9","type":"text","text":"`nmap -sT -v 10.10.104.227`","x":2260,"y":430,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"63f84662c9cdb874","type":"text","text":"`connect()` function call for every target port in a `linear manner` . bahut sare socket parallel m chal rahe hote hai isiliye ye bahut slow hota h","x":2980,"y":401,"width":320,"height":119},
		{"id":"28fc81716694d936","type":"text","text":"Stealth TCP Scanning methods","x":-139,"y":1147,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"33ebfe0b671252d1","type":"text","text":"3 way handshake complete hone se pahale hi ye  server or client ke bich ke connection ko reset kar deta hai or connection ko half open banata hai ","x":661,"y":845,"width":589,"height":79},
		{"id":"81aefdec989a7a74","type":"text","text":"Stealth Scan is also called a `SYN scan`. kyuki ye keval SYN packets hi send karta h","x":1350,"y":855,"width":366,"height":60},
		{"id":"1d16a367f399e668","type":"text","text":"Half open scan","x":315,"y":854,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b6f266643a7efc79","type":"text","text":"Open Ports","x":2097,"y":773,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"991521c71b79b66a","type":"text","text":"`nmap -sS -v $IP`","x":1800,"y":855,"width":157,"height":60},
		{"id":"d4feeaeabb765c1c","type":"text","text":"Close Ports","x":2097,"y":940,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"45c698744b0800f4","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN+PORT ------>S\nA <--- SYN+ACK       ------ S\nA ------- RST ---------->S","x":2480,"y":759,"width":280,"height":89},
		{"id":"fe949b06425da802","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN+PORT ------>S\n \nA <------- RST ---------- S","x":2480,"y":926,"width":260,"height":89},
		{"id":"3e3e57186ce37d11","type":"text","text":"Attack user Stealth Scan technique to bypass firewall rules and logging machanism","x":2980,"y":848,"width":380,"height":60},
		{"id":"e78f1db6c26882f0","type":"text","text":"Inverse TCP Flag scan","x":370,"y":1301,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7bab7cc0f4e4d431","type":"text","text":"Xmas Scan","x":1002,"y":1123,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b6546a0d741cf9b5","type":"text","text":"FIN scan","x":1002,"y":1223,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"70853c3220df6446","type":"text","text":"Null Scan","x":1002,"y":1331,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ab5f552cc11fc6db","type":"text","text":"Maimon Scan","x":1002,"y":1431,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3255207cbc76b297","type":"text","text":"Attacker TCP Probe packets send karega bina kisi flag ke. \nagar port open hoga to koi response nahi aayega or \nagar close hua to - RST ya ACK flag receive hoga","x":255,"y":1119,"width":480,"height":116},
		{"id":"d30f14c3a0abe028","type":"text","text":"**Inverse TCP Flag Scans** aisi scanning techniques hain jisme **SYN flag use nahi hota**. Iske badle dusre TCP flags (ya unka combination) bheja jata hai taaki port ki state ka pata chale.","x":255,"y":960,"width":480,"height":120},
		{"id":"52de6dbb389d9374","type":"text","text":"Xmas scan aisa scan hai jisme ham target ko `FIN+URG+PSH` packet send karate hai agr target\nopen : `no response`\nclose : `RST` flag","x":1350,"y":1003,"width":390,"height":120},
		{"id":"0ef75923ad973096","type":"text","text":"This scan only works when system are complaints with `RFC 793-based` TCP/IP implementation. microsoft ki current version par kam nahi karega ye","x":1800,"y":1003,"width":340,"height":120},
		{"id":"1f70f27d759849f4","type":"text","text":"BSD networking code\n```\nYe unix host par hi kam karega window par nahi\n```","x":2060,"y":1140,"width":460,"height":127},
		{"id":"15d8168707ea8c18","type":"text","text":"`nmap -sX -v $IP`","x":2637,"y":1171,"width":163,"height":60},
		{"id":"4066865ec0cd1c75","type":"text","text":"**FIN Scan** ek TCP port scanning technique hai jisme scanner **sirf FIN flag** set karke packet bhejta hai. Iska use port **open**, **closed**, ya **filtered** hone ka andaza lagane ke liye kiya jata hai.","x":1350,"y":1153,"width":410,"height":126},
		{"id":"38e01bc1b7f3c38e","type":"text","text":"`nmap -sF $IP`","x":1800,"y":1186,"width":149,"height":60},
		{"id":"1ff3e4aec6005a0e","type":"text","text":"Open : `no reply`","x":1685,"y":1331,"width":165,"height":60},
		{"id":"fa674e3a5cf617f9","type":"text","text":"Close : `RST`","x":1892,"y":1331,"width":115,"height":60},
		{"id":"54b71a8ce7e21ca9","type":"text","text":"**NULL Scan** ek TCP port scanning technique hai jisme **koi bhi TCP flag set nahi hota**.","x":1350,"y":1312,"width":260,"height":99},
		{"id":"0a06ace750b561e0","x":1610,"y":1442,"width":750,"height":99,"type":"text","text":"Normally TCP packet me kam se kam koi na koi flag hota hai.\nNULL Scan ek **abnormal packet** bhejta hai aur target ke response se port ki state pata karta hai.\nYe **RFC 793** ke behavior par based hai."},
		{"id":"4e3b25f9030c7d40","x":2490,"y":1462,"width":201,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -sN 192.168.1.10`"},
		{"id":"85800568330a614f","x":1213,"y":1561,"width":332,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Ye technique bilkul `NULL, FIN or Xmas` ki tarah h. ye jyadatar `FIN/ACK` use karati h"},
		{"id":"0565a003829f14c7","x":1610,"y":1561,"width":129,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -sM $IP`"},
		{"id":"d3f3640f3ce5e5af","type":"text","text":"A ---- FIN+ACK+PORT ------>S\n \nA <- ICMP UNREACHABLE ERROR  -- S","x":2140,"y":1562,"width":319,"height":89},
		{"id":"7a7e775c295a34de","type":"text","text":"A ---- FIN+ACK ------>S\n \nA <------- RST ---------- S","x":2140,"y":1676,"width":319,"height":89},
		{"id":"0abda620630d4316","type":"text","text":"A ---- FIN+ACK ------>S\n \nA <----- no res ---------- S","x":2140,"y":1796,"width":319,"height":89},
		{"id":"f86c1680fe021e55","x":1875,"y":1811,"width":87,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Open"},
		{"id":"9ea2b890e6714e88","x":1875,"y":1691,"width":87,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Close"},
		{"id":"d1e627493da06a25","x":1875,"y":1577,"width":87,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Filtered"},
		{"id":"7f77698b3452db9d","type":"text","text":"TTL based scan","x":980,"y":2080,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"338d50f9cb6d832c","type":"text","text":"IDLE/IP ID header scan","x":992,"y":2439,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"dfee02ffcf15d1c4","type":"text","text":"Third Party and Spoofed TCP scanning methods","x":610,"y":2339,"width":422,"height":60},
		{"id":"83431e3587b17fd1","type":"text","text":"ACK Flag Probe Scan","x":600,"y":2080,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1abc63b49686b5c6","x":540,"y":1900,"width":371,"height":121,"type":"text","text":"Attacker ACK flag ke sath TCK probe packet bhejata hai or use RST flag milata hai or us RST flag ke  header information ko analaye karake batata hai ki port open hai ya close"},
		{"id":"6661dd0884aebda6","x":980,"y":1900,"width":343,"height":121,"type":"text","text":"Tumko sabase pahale `ACK probe` packets `bhejane` ki jarurat hai `alag alag TCP ports par`. jo `RST packet `receive hoga usake `TTL field ki value ko analyze `karana. "},
		{"id":"f86309305987e833","x":1843,"y":2040,"width":238,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"###### ICMP DATA\nTotal 64bytes\nData = 56 bytes\nICMP Header = 8 bytes"},
		{"id":"4d63ba074bc094a7","x":2263,"y":2010,"width":71,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Open"},
		{"id":"e9e9188dce10a258","x":2263,"y":2141,"width":73,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Close"},
		{"id":"6941ff37028e18a0","x":2424,"y":2008,"width":596,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Agar RST packets ki `TTL` value `64bytes se kam` hoti hai tab ye `open` hoga"},
		{"id":"9152031e3585d69b","type":"text","text":"Agar RST packets ki `TTL` value `64bytes se jyada` hoti hai tab ye `close` hoga","x":2424,"y":2141,"width":596,"height":60},
		{"id":"4f6100532a6d2b1f","type":"text","text":"Tumko sabase pahale `ACK probe` packets `bhejane` ki jarurat hai `alag alag TCP ports par`. jo `RST packet `receive hoga usake `Window field ki value ko analyze `karana. ","x":1323,"y":2231,"width":389,"height":121},
		{"id":"6ded3da234d3cf52","type":"text","text":"Window based scan","x":980,"y":2261,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"95381f2978c40b19","type":"text","text":"Open","x":2844,"y":2222,"width":71,"height":60},
		{"id":"b217f76590cf3be2","type":"text","text":"Close","x":2844,"y":2353,"width":73,"height":60},
		{"id":"c80b03a31575cde8","type":"text","text":"Kisi bhi `RST PACKETS` ki value `non-zero` hoti hai isaka mtlb h ki port `open` hai","x":3005,"y":2220,"width":596,"height":60},
		{"id":"69c9f35256d6115c","type":"text","text":"###### ICMP DATA\nTotal 64bytes\nData = 56 bytes\nICMP Header = 8 bytes","x":2424,"y":2252,"width":238,"height":140},
		{"id":"f36bb8e358b9bf1b","type":"text","text":"`nmap -sW 192.168.1.10`","x":2061,"y":2292,"width":232,"height":60},
		{"id":"a223520fd700f1b6","x":1480,"y":2050,"width":232,"height":121,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -ttl [time] [target]`\n```\nnmap -ttl 5 $IP\n```"},
		{"id":"d604733481afcd49","type":"text","text":"Kisi bhi `RST PACKETS` ki value `zero` hoti hai isaka mtlb h ki port `close` hai","x":3005,"y":2353,"width":596,"height":60},
		{"id":"f80b8be486eb393a","x":1323,"y":2404,"width":389,"height":130,"type":"text","text":"IDLE/IPID header `TCP port scanning` ka use karata hai. jisame `spoofed source address` bheja jata hai or determine kiya jata hai ki kon se ports `open` hai"},
		{"id":"5c68a433c5bc83df","x":1421,"y":2731,"width":71,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Open"},
		{"id":"88d1bb86f5af6506","x":1572,"y":2731,"width":73,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Close"},
		{"id":"513841c4dad7b8a8","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN ------>S\nA <--- SYN+ACK       ------ S\n","x":1112,"y":2732,"width":260,"height":59},
		{"id":"678e8d36eef7ae9a","type":"text","text":"A ---- SYN ------>S\nA ------- RST ---------->S","x":1752,"y":2720,"width":260,"height":83},
		{"id":"75624836ca3189a5","x":1341,"y":2580,"width":354,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -Pn -p- -sI 10.10.1.1 10.10.1.254`"},
		{"id":"3d7b0b8585e5cf68","x":1752,"y":2409,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`-sI` for IDLE/IPID scan"},
		{"id":"64e456ea079972ed","x":1959,"y":2494,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Isko Zombie Scan bhi bolate h"},
		{"id":"e7dd90a0ae355f0e","type":"text","text":"UDP scanning","x":-740,"y":1087,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d6ea0a3fa2731cbd","type":"text","text":"IPv6 Scanning","x":-1020,"y":1087,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"268c58a9de7be92e","type":"text","text":"SCTP Scanning","x":-1512,"y":859,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bc56a13db9b6b10f","x":-740,"y":1185,"width":250,"height":115,"type":"text","text":"Udp mai agar koi `ICMP error` aayi to port `close` h or agar `koi response hi nahi aaya` to `open` h"},
		{"id":"0a2598698479b5c0","x":-740,"y":1514,"width":71,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Open"},
		{"id":"7b659e299b180f4e","x":-563,"y":1514,"width":73,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Close"},
