		{"id":"a69117ca8c1b0170","type":"text","text":"A ---- UDP+PORT ------>S\nA <--- ICMP Error  ------ S\n ","x":-419,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":89},
		{"id":"2acc69c186e56385","x":-691,"y":1360,"width":153,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -pU -v $IP`"},
		{"id":"ddd4e3eba885591b","type":"text","text":"SCTP COOKIE/ECHO Scan","x":-1360,"y":1087,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6e1330973e325d97","type":"text","text":"SCTP INIT Scanning","x":-1637,"y":1087,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3468e326bb8fe71f","x":-2080,"y":969,"width":351,"height":297,"type":"text","text":"SCTP ek message oriented transport layer hai. jo TCP UDP ke alternative use hoti hai. ye jyadatar multi homing ya multi streaming ke liye use hoti hai. \n- VoIP\n- IP Telephony\n- Signaling system 7\n- Signaling Transport (ss7/SIGTRAN)\n- SCTP association\n- 4 WAY handshake method"},
		{"id":"2862d06afe154305","x":-2580,"y":918,"width":347,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Cyber Security Practically/screenshots/association_4_way_handshake.png"},
		{"id":"ce7ee19928c1603b","x":-2483,"y":780,"width":153,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -sY -v $IP`"},
		{"id":"7a417aa363e4e53e","x":-2080,"y":679,"width":400,"height":263,"type":"file","file":"Cyber Security Practically/screenshots/SCTP_SCAN.png"},
		{"id":"dd33e2ed57d097f5","x":-1503,"y":1185,"width":537,"height":135,"type":"text","text":"SCTP Cookie Echo Scan (`-sY`) is an Nmap scan used to discover SCTP services. It sends an SCTP COOKIE ECHO chunk instead of completing a full SCTP connection. A COOKIE ACK response indicates an open port, while an ABORT response indicates a closed port."},
		{"id":"2af34ecf9bbd36c1","x":-1503,"y":1360,"width":537,"height":124,"type":"text","text":"IPv6 is the sixth version of the Internet Protocol that uses 128-bit addresses instead of IPv4's 32-bit addresses. It provides a much larger address space, improved routing, and features like Neighbor Discovery and automatic address configuration."},
		{"id":"8895e97f122beeb1","x":-1119,"y":1514,"width":153,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`nmap -6 $Domain`"}
	],
